      "tag": "p",
      "children": [
        "Apartment elevators are one of the most important systems in residential buildings because they provide comfort, convenience, and smooth movement between floors every day. However, many apartment residents in Bangalore often notice unusual sounds coming from elevators over time. Strange noises inside a lift can become irritating and may also indicate mechanical or electrical problems that need immediate attention. Many property owners ignore these warning signs until the elevator starts facing frequent breakdowns or safety issues. Professional ",
        {
