          "attributes": {
            "href": "/lift-contractors-bangalore-bg-elevators"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "children": ["lift contractors in Bangalore"]
            }
          ]
        },
        " often explain that elevator noise problems should never be neglected because they can become more serious if repairs are delayed. Companies like BG Elevators help apartment owners identify the root causes of elevator noise and provide effective maintenance and modernization solutions for smooth and silent operation."
      ]
